    "thresholds": [
      "0.80",
      "0.75",
      "0.70",
      "0.65",
      "0.60"
    ],
    "threshold_note": "loc_support / dense_support keys are the support counts (blocks with correlation >= threshold) at each threshold, measured at the closest-to-ground-truth evaluation. Support counts are counted over informative blocks (15 per pcb/metal case).",
    "honesty_note": "Cases with loc_support null have no localized per-block measurement; the program reports UNKNOWN for loc-based rules instead of inventing values. WrongTarget loc_support at thresholds other than 0.80 is exactly derived (see each case), not measured per block. Textured impostors have only a dense@0.80 count, so no 0.70 verdict is computable from this file."
  },
